OL,3,GNEWSAJeffrey Donaldson's child sex
OL,4,Aabuse convictions 'obliterate' life's
OL,5,Awork
OL,6,
OL,7,FJeffrey Donaldson's convictions for
OL,8,Fchild sex abuse "obliterate" the
OL,9,Fachievements he made in his life and
OL,10,F"he will have to live with that", a
OL,11,Fcourt has heard.
OL,13,FThe former Democratic Unionist Party
OL,14,F(DUP) leader appeared in the dock at
OL,15,FNewry Crown Court as the prosecution
OL,16,Fand defence teams made their
OL,17,Fsubmissions prior to his sentencing
OL,18,Fnext month.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
