OL,3,GNEWSAJeffrey Donaldson's child sex
OL,4,Aabuse convictions 'obliterate' life's
OL,5,Awork
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonaldson was convicted in June of 18
OL,8,Fcounts of sex abuse including one of
OL,9,Frape, which he committed against two
OL,10,Fwomen when they were children.
OL,12,FHe is seeking to appeal his
OL,13,Fconvictions.
